    "A": "$\\frac{1}{k}\\tan^{- 1}{(\\frac{ku^{2}}{2g})}$",
    "B": "$\\frac{1}{2k}\\tan^{- 1}{(\\frac{ku^{2}}{g})}$",
    "C": "$\\frac{1}{2k}\\ \\ln (1 + \\frac{ku^{2}}{g})$",
    "D": "$\\frac{1}{k}\\ \\ln (1 + \\frac{ku^{2}}{2g})$"
  },
